    "name": "A Python3 program to count number of",
    "code": "# A Python3 program to count number of\n# substrings starting and ending with 1\n \n \ndef countSubStr(st, n):\n \n    # Count of 1's in input string\n    m = 0\n \n    # Traverse input string and\n    # count of 1's in it\n    for i in range(0, n):\n        if (st[i] == '1'):\n            m = m + 1\n \n    # Return count of possible\n    # pairs among m 1's\n    return m * (m - 1) // 2\n \n \n# Driver program to test above function\nst = \"00100101\"\nlist(st)\nn = len(st)\nprint(countSubStr(st, n), end=\"\")\n \n \n# This code is contributed\n# by Nikita Tiwari.",
