    "name": "Sorting based Python 3 program",
    "code": "# Sorting based Python 3 program\n# to find all elements in array\n# which have atleast two greater\n# elements itself.\n \ndef findElements(arr, n):\n \n    arr.sort()\n \n    for i in range(0, n-2):\n        print(arr[i], end =\" \")\n \n# Driven source\narr = [2, -6, 3, 5, 1]\nn = len(arr)\nfindElements(arr, n)\n \n# This code is contributed\n# by Smitha Dinesh Semwal",
